    <string name="wheel_title">Taskbar and wheel</string>
    <string name="wheel_summary">Taskbar, wheel modes and the side button</string>
    <string name="wheel_ui">Use the wheel UI</string>
    <string name="wheel_about">The wheel opens the taskbar at the edge of the screen: home, all apps, your pinned and running apps, notifications, the wheel mode of the app in front and these settings. The wheel moves, the side button picks, a double press of the side button brings the taskbar back from any app.\n\nSwitched off, the r1 looks and works like stock Android.</string>

